  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROBA L.P. Central American Banking Growth Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project consists of a US$6 million investment in ProBa, L.P., Central American Banking Growth Fund, a regional private equity fund that will target the rapidly growing financial sector in Central America and Panama. The investee companies must satisfy the eligibility criteria established by the IIC. The Fund has a target capitalization of US$60 million.</narrative>
  </description>
